  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 532fe926c7aac1b438cb9b71cd19eaf9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Candy
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CreatureData
  creatureName: Sweetmeat
  description: It appears to be a slimier variant of some kind of lichen capable
    of simple thought. It has a special taste for sweets and is probably the cause
    of many kids disappearing in the forest, maybe attracted by the candy it drops
    or maybe because it eats the candy trail some kids leave to know their way back.
  note: "Note from Luc\xEDa: Its eyes are funny and it skips around the forest. One
    time I tried to feed it some candy but it was so full it dropped another one
    trying to eat the one I gave it.\r\n"
  family: 2
  favoriteScent: 0
  hatedScent: 1
